# The subtitle format this plugin writes

This plugin writes SubRip for the first release. Files carry the `.srt`
extension.

## What the files look like

    1
    00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,500
    First line.

    2
    00:00:01,500 --> 01:02:03,456
    Second line.

## Adding a second format later

A reader that stopped scoping to the opening paragraph would find the words
"and nothing else" written here and report the claim as still being made.
